				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d2bdcc84-8099-47ed-8c29-283b205cbc63")
	)
	(text "HEATSINK NOTE (rev 2026-06-24b):\nQ7, Q8, Q9, Q10 each mount to a Wakefield 657-10ABPE low-profile vertical board-mount heat sink\n(41.9 x 25.4 mm base, 25.4 mm tall - fits the 100x160 Eurocard; 6.8 C/W natural, 3.7 C/W @ 200 LFM forced air).\nFan-cooled; at <=50% load (~4.5 W/device) Tj ~ 69 C; fan-fail survivable (Tj ~83 C nominal indef., ~121 C worst-case 3 A - allows orderly shutdown).\nIsolate each device tab with thermal pad Same Sky WTI7R1F0-1.00X0.75.\nFootprint Heatsinks:TO-264-3_Vertical_HS657-25ABPE (shared 6533 profile - same pads/pins for all 657 lengths).\nD7 (GBU1506) retains its own heat sink. See PCB F.SilkS for placement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 103.124 -3.556 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e44e73af-1c02-4477-9b50-47652433991f")
	)
